# C3: the std submodules mlmf-exl2 may name. Grows one commit at a time,
# each entry landing beside the code that forced it.
#
# `error` -- `impl std::error::Error for DetectError`/`Unsupported`.
# `fmt`   -- `impl std::fmt::Display for DetectError`/`Unsupported`,
#   hand-written rather than derived because the message is free text the
#   caller should see as-is.
error
fmt
